      "id": "50c5a4ec2303aa5d",
      "title": "Show HN: Tamper-evident audit trail for AI coding agent activity",
      "source": "Hacker News (AI 关键词)",
      "category": "A",
      "url": "https://github.com/Constellation-Labs/gate-oc-audit",
      "published_raw": "Mon, 15 Jun 2026 23:01:09 +0000",
      "published_parsed": [
        2026,
        6,
        15,
        23,
        1,
        9,
        0,
        166,
        0
      ],
      "raw_text": "<p>We released what I've been working in the last few months: an Openclaw plugin that ecords every session, tool invocation, and prompt exchange into a local SQLite database with SHA-256 hash chain integrity, so you can verify that no events were altered or deleted after the fact.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48548225\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48548225</a></p>\n<p>Points: 3</p>\n<p># Comments: 0</p>",
      "published_at": "2026-06-16T07:01:09+08:00",
      "keep": true,
      "scores": {
        "source_authority_score": 60,
        "freshness_score": 80,
        "ai_relevance_score": 70,
        "product_relevance_score": 62,
        "technical_impact_score": 62,
        "community_heat_score": 20
      },
      "final_score": 62,
      "summary_zh": "开源Openclaw插件发布，为AI编程智能体提供防篡改审计追踪：将每次会话、工具调用和提示词交换记录至本地SQLite数据库，并使用SHA-256哈希链保障完整性，可事后验证任何事件是否被篡改或删除。",
      "why_zh": "填补AI编程智能体可审计性空白，直接解决企业合规与安全监管的核心诉求。",
      "tags": [
        "AI Coding",
        "Open Source",
        "Agent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b8bd239a66057c00",
      "title": "Show HN: Open-source CLI to see your AI coding token usage and compare it",
      "source": "Hacker News (AI 关键词)",
      "category": "A",
      "url": "https://github.com/amiinwani/whoburnedmore.com",
      "published_raw": "Tue, 16 Jun 2026 01:03:04 +0000",
      "published_parsed": [
        2026,
        6,
        16,
        1,
        3,
        4,
        1,
        167,
        0
      ],
      "raw_text": "<p>I use Claude Code, Codex, Cursor every day and had no idea how much I was actually burning across all of them combined. Each tool shows its own usage (most don't) in its own place, if at all, and I just wanted one number. So I wrote this.<p>npx whoburnedmore<p>reads the usage/log files these tools already write locally, sums them up, and prints a dashboard: total tokens, a cost estimate, active days, and your heaviest single day.<p>There is also a public leaderboard on the webiste which compares your ai usage with all others<p>Feedback & a upvote is appreciated<p>github is /amiinwani/whoburnedmore.com\nproduct hunt : <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/whoburnedmore\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.producthunt.com/products/whoburnedmore</a></p>\n<hr />\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48549250\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48549250</a></p>\n<p>Points: 1</p>\n<p># Comments: 0</p>",
      "published_at": "2026-06-16T09:03:04+08:00",
      "keep": true,
      "scores": {
        "source_authority_score": 50,
        "freshness_score": 85,
        "ai_relevance_score": 70,
        "product_relevance_score": 75,
        "technical_impact_score": 50,
        "community_heat_score": 30
      },
      "final_score": 62,
      "summary_zh": "开源CLI工具whoburnedmore，通过读取Claude Code、Codex、Cursor等AI编程工具本地生成的日志文件，汇总显示token消耗总量、成本估算、活跃天数及单日峰值，并提供公共排行榜横向比较功能。",
      "why_zh": "统一追踪多AI编码工具token消耗，解决成本不透明痛点。",
      "tags": [
        "AI Coding",
        "Open Source"
      ]
    },
